* Include the tuition center's logo where available.
* Include the receipt number, student name, billing reference, amount, payment method, payment date, and authorized center details.
* Provide print and PDF-export functionality where supported.
* Do not claim a payment was successful merely because the receipt screen opened.
* Generate receipts from persisted, confirmed payment records.

